flowchart TD
    I[Implementation] --> R[Review]
    R --> V[Validation]
    V --> E[Evaluation]
    E --> D{Required Checks Satisfied?}
    D -- No --> C[Return for Correction]
    D -- Yes --> H[Pending Human Approval]
    H --> A{Approved?}
    A -- No --> B[Remain Unapproved]
    A -- Yes --> N[Authorized Next Action]
